cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use this app, please cite this release and Pennsieve (RRID:SCR_021677); the works it
  builds on (the KGX format and Biolink Model, and the open-source libraries it uses) are listed
  under references.
type: software
title: KG Summary
abstract: >-
  A Pennsieve app that summarises a dataset's knowledge graph (a KGX graph of its metadata
  records and the ontology terms they use): size, the category-predicate-category metagraph,
  connected components and degree distribution, hubs, ontology use and data-quality flags, as
  report.json, report.md, CSV tables and a degree histogram.
